# The mod performs its own biome-generation injection on Fabric because there is no Fabric API
# biome-modification facility available. It also needs a handful of vanilla members that Forge and
# NeoForge already expose as public (so the shared, loader-agnostic sources compile everywhere).
# Fabric Loader applies this widener natively; no API mod is required.

# Biome injection: rebuild biome generation settings and the chunk-generator feature order.
